ifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":22,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"   python3 .codex/skills/present-changes-visually/scripts/generate-split-view-diff.py \\","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":23,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"     . HEAD WORKTREE _temp/visual-diff.html","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":24,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"   ```","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":25,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":26,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"   Replace `HEAD`, `WORKTREE`, and the output path with the requested values. The comparison points can be any Git commit-ish such as `HEAD~1`, a tag, a branch, or a commit SHA. Use `WORKTREE` for the current files.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":27,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":28,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"5. Confirm the command succeeded and report the absolute path to the generated page. Do not open a browser unless the user asks.","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":29,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":30,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"## Verify output","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":31,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"","lastModifiedDate":"2026-08-19T16:00:42","isFullCredit":false},{"lineNumber":32,"author":{"gitId":"BenjaminWong33"},"content":"Check that the page exists and that the generator\u0027s summary reports the expected changed-f